# idea-filing — files one approved idea-card on the AgentPack Trello board, once, as a card written in Italian

POLICY idea-filing-safety:
    ABOUT    what may be written on Trello, where, and with whose approval
    APPLIES  #idea-filing-safety

    NEVER   write anything on the board before the user approves its exact text
    NEVER   file a card that duplicates one already on the board
    ALWAYS  add an agreed duplicate as a comment on the card already there
    NEVER   change any other card in any way

TEMPLATE trello-card:
    ABOUT  one Trello card or comment, as it will be written on the board
    SLOTS:
        name:         TEXT  "the card's name: the idea-card's title, in Italian"
        description:  TEXT  "the idea-card's body in Italian, headings included, a blank line between blocks, identifiers and code unchanged"

VAR idea
VAR same-card
VAR draft AS trello-card

@WITH idea-filing-safety
PROCEDURE find-same-cards:
    ABOUT  read the cards of the AgentPack board that cover one idea
    DO  call the Trello REST API directly, with TRELLO_API_KEY and TRELLO_TOKEN read from `/home/giuseppe/PhpstormProjects/cardrunner/.env`
    DO  read the cards of the AgentPack board that cover the same idea

@WITH idea-filing-safety
PROCEDURE file-idea:
    ABOUT  file one idea-card in the target column of the board, or as a comment on the card that already holds the idea
    VAR column:
        DO  take the list named `Raw cards` with id `6abd26a83b11cf3ff48a5ec7`
    DO  read the idea-card the user approved INTO idea
    RUN  find-same-cards INTO same-card
    IF a card in {{same-card}} is the same idea:
        DO  show it to the user
        DO  ask whether to add the idea to it as a comment instead
        DO  stop until they answer
    DO  write the title of {{idea}} as the name and its body as the description, both in Italian INTO draft
    UNTIL the user approves the exact text of the draft or drops it:
        DO  show {{draft}} to the user exactly as it will be written
        DO  tell the user the column {{column}} is where the card will go
    IF the user approved the draft:
        DO  create the card from {{draft}} in the list {{column}}, through the Trello REST API
        DO  give the user the link of the card

EXPORT SKILL idea-filing:
    ABOUT    Load when the user asks to put a formalized idea on Trello: files one idea-card as a card
    APPLIES  #idea-filing
    MANDATE  file only approved ideas, once, on the right board

    WHEN the user asks to file an idea that is already an idea-card:
        RUN  file-idea

    WHEN asked which cards of the board already cover an idea:
        RUN  find-same-cards

    WHEN the user asks to file an idea that is not formalized yet:
        DO  tell the user the idea needs the idea-shaping skill first
        DO  offer to shape it now
